# Mukijo Workflow Diagram

## Personas (entry)

```
Landing (/)
 ├─ Club Admin     → /login | /register
 ├─ Member         → /login-member | /register-member
 ├─ Venue Owner    → /login-venue | /register-venue
 ├─ Trainer        → /login-trainer | /register-trainer   ← NEW
 └─ User           → /login-user | /register-user
```

